    "text": "Cosine similarity runs from minus one to one while lexical scores are unbounded above, so both are mapped to a common range before any weighting is applied. Weighting. A fixed weighting of 0.4 lexical to 0.5 semantic performed well across query types. Weights are normalised over whichever retrievers actually ran, so a keyword-only query still spans the full score range.",
